@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5062

### 1. 获取所有医生 (GET)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/doctor
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. 创建一个新医生 (POST)
# 注意：这里的字段要和你 Models/Doctor.cs 中的属性名一致（通常是首字母大写或小写均可）
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/doctor
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "张医生",
  "specialty": "内科",
  "description": "资深主治医师",
  "email": "zhang@example.com",
  "phone": "13800000000"
}

###

### 3. 根据 ID 获取单个医生 (GET)
# 假设刚才创建的医生 ID 是 1
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/doctor/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. 更新医生信息 (PUT)
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/doctor/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "张大夫 (已更新)",
  "specialty": "外科",
  "description": "心脏外科专家",
  "email": "zhang_new@example.com",
  "phone": "13911112222"
}

###

### 5. 删除医生 (DELETE)
DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/doctor/1